{
  "bvid": "BV1Vw411c7Cd",
  "page": 1,
  "source": "subtitle-ai",
  "language": "ai-zh",
  "model": null,
  "content_sha256": "182375e4017743d02fece1d44a8203b1c576b51afd93a8a09052a9173a1d8764",
  "segments": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 6020,
      "text": "呃其实我们要讲的就是说呃我们应该非常乐观"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "start_ms": 6020,
      "end_ms": 7729,
      "text": "不should be"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "start_ms": 7729,
      "end_ms": 9229,
      "text": "我们应该非常乐观"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "start_ms": 10309,
      "end_ms": 15169,
      "text": "那么我们要聊的就是说最近一个是什么啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "start_ms": 15169,
      "end_ms": 16640,
      "text": "郭继承"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "start_ms": 16640,
      "end_ms": 21440,
      "text": "郭老师和还有一个小年轻戴眼镜的长"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "start_ms": 21440,
      "end_ms": 22790,
      "text": "卖相还可以的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "start_ms": 22790,
      "end_ms": 24980,
      "text": "他们搞了一个什么节目啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "start_ms": 24980,
      "end_ms": 31140,
      "text": "什么就是孔夫子孔老二"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "start_ms": 32720,
      "end_ms": 34840,
      "text": "和这个马克思啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "start_ms": 34840,
      "end_ms": 36460,
      "text": "说这两个人是什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "start_ms": 36460,
      "end_ms": 37060,
      "text": "心有灵犀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "start_ms": 37060,
      "end_ms": 39100,
      "text": "心心相通啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "start_ms": 40020,
      "end_ms": 42770,
      "text": "啊这里面蕴含一个逻辑"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "start_ms": 42770,
      "end_ms": 47320,
      "text": "其实一个逻辑在运动着"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "start_ms": 47540,
      "end_ms": 50290,
      "text": "They have something in common"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "start_ms": 50870,
      "end_ms": 52510,
      "text": "他们有相同的东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "start_ms": 52510,
      "end_ms": 54800,
      "text": "天下为公啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "start_ms": 54800,
      "end_ms": 57830,
      "text": "这是这个是我们的这个伟大的这个先行者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "start_ms": 57830,
      "end_ms": 62030,
      "text": "孙文呢啊中山先生"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "start_ms": 62030,
      "end_ms": 63865,
      "text": "他在他的那个"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "start_ms": 65880,
      "end_ms": 67670,
      "text": "所以说那个什么戴季陶"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "start_ms": 67670,
      "end_ms": 70080,
      "text": "戴季陶也喜欢搞这个"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "start_ms": 70080,
      "end_ms": 73260,
      "text": "就是说民族主义的一种叙事"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "start_ms": 73260,
      "end_ms": 76140,
      "text": "说你这欧洲的什么新的理念啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "start_ms": 76140,
      "end_ms": 80419,
      "text": "其实我们中国早就有我们这什么孔子"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "start_ms": 80419,
      "end_ms": 82219,
      "text": "早就有天下为公的儒家"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "start_ms": 82219,
      "end_ms": 84439,
      "text": "早就有什么墨子兼爱啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "start_ms": 84439,
      "end_ms": 87820,
      "text": "那个时候就实际上是一种啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "start_ms": 88160,
      "end_ms": 90640,
      "text": "民族主义起步的时候"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "start_ms": 90640,
      "end_ms": 91600,
      "text": "刚起步的时候"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "start_ms": 91600,
      "end_ms": 97190,
      "text": "要在自己的民族经典里面找一些东西来代替"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "start_ms": 97190,
      "end_ms": 98750,
      "text": "代替舶来品"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "start_ms": 98750,
      "end_ms": 102620,
      "text": "但实际上就是要让舶来品落地"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "start_ms": 102620,
      "end_ms": 106090,
      "text": "要给舶来品以落地的位置啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "start_ms": 106090,
      "end_ms": 109000,
      "text": "它可以就可以就是展开了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "start_ms": 109000,
      "end_ms": 112000,
      "text": "只不过说展开的时候不说这是舶来品"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "start_ms": 112000,
      "end_ms": 113020,
      "text": "不是外面的东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "start_ms": 113020,
      "end_ms": 114160,
      "text": "说给他套个名目"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "start_ms": 114160,
      "end_ms": 115000,
      "text": "说这是墨子的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "start_ms": 115000,
      "end_ms": 116830,
      "text": "说这是孔子的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "start_ms": 118610,
      "end_ms": 119590,
      "text": "天下为公"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "start_ms": 121570,
      "end_ms": 123310,
      "text": "天下大同"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "start_ms": 123950,
      "end_ms": 130070,
      "text": "这些中国传统的理念啊啊这些中国传统的理念"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "start_ms": 132710,
      "end_ms": 136460,
      "text": "其实你真的要挖这些传统理念"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "start_ms": 136460,
      "end_ms": 137180,
      "text": "你怎么挖呀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "start_ms": 137180,
      "end_ms": 138860,
      "text": "你难道活到几千年前去吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "start_ms": 138860,
      "end_ms": 140840,
      "text": "他总是在现实当中展开的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "start_ms": 140840,
      "end_ms": 142510,
      "text": "现实当中诞生的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "start_ms": 142510,
      "end_ms": 146590,
      "text": "那么对此我是非常有信心的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "start_ms": 146590,
      "end_ms": 148930,
      "text": "因为something in common"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "start_ms": 148930,
      "end_ms": 151860,
      "text": "哪怕是two things in common"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "start_ms": 152260,
      "end_ms": 155400,
      "text": "哪怕是两个呃"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "start_ms": 155600,
      "end_ms": 159580,
      "text": "他就是说这里面的逻辑都是普遍性的逻辑"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "start_ms": 159580,
      "end_ms": 163830,
      "text": "你没发现这里面的逻辑都是普遍性的逻辑啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "start_ms": 163830,
      "end_ms": 166710,
      "text": "孔夫子他反正那个节目我没看了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "start_ms": 166710,
      "end_ms": 168450,
      "text": "我大概也知道他里面会说什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "start_ms": 168450,
      "end_ms": 170610,
      "text": "孔夫子有一些天下为公的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "start_ms": 170610,
      "end_ms": 174600,
      "text": "有一些什么人类大同的担当的这样的一个追求"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "start_ms": 174600,
      "end_ms": 176880,
      "text": "这是个普遍性的运动歌手"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "start_ms": 176880,
      "end_ms": 181040,
      "text": "那你这个这个马克思也有这样的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "start_ms": 181040,
      "end_ms": 181880,
      "text": "普遍的一个追求"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "start_ms": 181880,
      "end_ms": 184070,
      "text": "也有伟大的追求"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 63,
      "start_ms": 185190,
      "end_ms": 188210,
      "text": "你要儒家的那些士农工商等级制这些东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 64,
      "start_ms": 188210,
      "end_ms": 190150,
      "text": "马克思有没有"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 65,
      "start_ms": 190430,
      "end_ms": 192010,
      "text": "It's not something in common"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 66,
      "start_ms": 192010,
      "end_ms": 194290,
      "text": "不是不是他们共有的东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 67,
      "start_ms": 194290,
      "end_ms": 196580,
      "text": "那就是说这种节目"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 68,
      "start_ms": 196580,
      "end_ms": 199160,
      "text": "那做来做去还是得从这两个东西找"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 69,
      "start_ms": 199160,
      "end_ms": 199940,
      "text": "你离谱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 70,
      "start_ms": 199940,
      "end_ms": 200660,
      "text": "不能离大谱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 71,
      "start_ms": 200660,
      "end_ms": 201020,
      "text": "对不对"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 72,
      "start_ms": 201020,
      "end_ms": 203120,
      "text": "你还是要找啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 73,
      "start_ms": 203120,
      "end_ms": 204890,
      "text": "也就是说社会安定稳定"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 74,
      "start_ms": 204890,
      "end_ms": 206990,
      "text": "那总归在追求社会安定稳定的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 75,
      "start_ms": 206990,
      "end_ms": 208530,
      "text": "要有秩序了啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 76,
      "start_ms": 208530,
      "end_ms": 210660,
      "text": "要不用不要用金钱逻辑啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 77,
      "start_ms": 210660,
      "end_ms": 211500,
      "text": "像孔夫子说"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 78,
      "start_ms": 211500,
      "end_ms": 212160,
      "text": "君子好财"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 79,
      "start_ms": 212160,
      "end_ms": 212700,
      "text": "取之有道"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 80,
      "start_ms": 212700,
      "end_ms": 215110,
      "text": "不是儒家传统的儒家传统"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 81,
      "start_ms": 215110,
      "end_ms": 215710,
      "text": "君子好财"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 82,
      "start_ms": 215710,
      "end_ms": 218100,
      "text": "马要要要有相应的这个什么什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 83,
      "start_ms": 218100,
      "end_ms": 220140,
      "text": "那这个也是要千亿啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 84,
      "start_ms": 220140,
      "end_ms": 222540,
      "text": "反正我至少要压压制这个资本的逻辑"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 85,
      "start_ms": 222540,
      "end_ms": 224000,
      "text": "金钱的逻辑"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 86,
      "start_ms": 224000,
      "end_ms": 225020,
      "text": "无论如何"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 87,
      "start_ms": 225020,
      "end_ms": 227240,
      "text": "这里面表达一个核心的意涵"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 88,
      "start_ms": 227240,
      "end_ms": 229700,
      "text": "是要在两个普遍性当中"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 89,
      "start_ms": 229700,
      "end_ms": 234470,
      "text": "两个都据说自己有普遍性的这个体系当中呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 90,
      "start_ms": 234470,
      "end_ms": 237579,
      "text": "寻求更大的普遍性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 91,
      "start_ms": 237799,
      "end_ms": 241359,
      "text": "那把彼此相互之间比较有特点的一些东西呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 92,
      "start_ms": 241359,
      "end_ms": 243099,
      "text": "实际上是可以啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 93,
      "start_ms": 243099,
      "end_ms": 246170,
      "text": "可以省略略略开"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 94,
      "start_ms": 246170,
      "end_ms": 249650,
      "text": "那么我觉得在这个意义上讲"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 95,
      "start_ms": 251900,
      "end_ms": 253180,
      "text": "common的逻辑"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 96,
      "start_ms": 253180,
      "end_ms": 254650,
      "text": "共同点的逻辑"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 97,
      "start_ms": 254650,
      "end_ms": 256720,
      "text": "我刚刚搜了characteristic"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 98,
      "start_ms": 256720,
      "end_ms": 260620,
      "text": "这个词的反义词是什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 99,
      "start_ms": 260779,
      "end_ms": 261459,
      "text": "Common"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 100,
      "start_ms": 263020,
      "end_ms": 268190,
      "text": "那么在这个意义上就意味着这个整个核心的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 101,
      "start_ms": 268190,
      "end_ms": 270650,
      "text": "我不认为这是什么待机讨主义啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 102,
      "start_ms": 270650,
      "end_ms": 272540,
      "text": "我不认为这是待机陶主义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 103,
      "start_ms": 272540,
      "end_ms": 275209,
      "text": "我不认为这是待机讨主义啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 104,
      "start_ms": 275209,
      "end_ms": 279539,
      "text": "这必然不是一种带机头主义啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 105,
      "start_ms": 279539,
      "end_ms": 280799,
      "text": "带几套这种宵"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 106,
      "start_ms": 280799,
      "end_ms": 286600,
      "text": "小这种拿不上台面来的废物渣渣小货色"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 107,
      "start_ms": 287180,
      "end_ms": 291010,
      "text": "它不能代表一个新的时代的一个大的潮流"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 108,
      "start_ms": 291010,
      "end_ms": 294789,
      "text": "一个伟大的时代的一个真正的转化"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 109,
      "start_ms": 294789,
      "end_ms": 298690,
      "text": "我觉得这个时代就意味着我们的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 110,
      "start_ms": 298690,
      "end_ms": 300670,
      "text": "我们这个民族的底蕴"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 111,
      "start_ms": 300670,
      "end_ms": 303670,
      "text": "我们的传承的这个特色啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 112,
      "start_ms": 303670,
      "end_ms": 309740,
      "text": "我们整个这个中华传统当中的鲜明的色彩"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 113,
      "start_ms": 310020,
      "end_ms": 312540,
      "text": "在越来越亮"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 114,
      "start_ms": 312540,
      "end_ms": 314550,
      "text": "越来越闪亮闪亮"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 115,
      "start_ms": 314550,
      "end_ms": 316200,
      "text": "它就变成一种光亮"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 116,
      "start_ms": 316200,
      "end_ms": 318750,
      "text": "这光亮呢它越来越像"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 117,
      "start_ms": 318750,
      "end_ms": 321800,
      "text": "像这个无论是红光还是黄光"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 118,
      "start_ms": 321800,
      "end_ms": 322760,
      "text": "反正这个光越来越亮"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 119,
      "start_ms": 322760,
      "end_ms": 324240,
      "text": "越来越亮"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 120,
      "start_ms": 324240,
      "end_ms": 326700,
      "text": "他的那个本来那个颜色也就越来越淡"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 121,
      "start_ms": 326700,
      "end_ms": 327360,
      "text": "越来越淡"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 122,
      "start_ms": 327360,
      "end_ms": 330110,
      "text": "而变成一个普遍的光"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 123,
      "start_ms": 330690,
      "end_ms": 332210,
      "text": "颜色越来越淡嘛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 124,
      "start_ms": 332210,
      "end_ms": 336830,
      "text": "也就是它的这个特殊性在越来越越来越消极"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 125,
      "start_ms": 336830,
      "end_ms": 339720,
      "text": "它的普遍性共通性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 126,
      "start_ms": 339720,
      "end_ms": 342200,
      "text": "全人类的普遍性共通性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 127,
      "start_ms": 342200,
      "end_ms": 345080,
      "text": "哪怕你说是说把把马克思主义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 128,
      "start_ms": 345080,
      "end_ms": 346280,
      "text": "把马马学给他"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 129,
      "start_ms": 346280,
      "end_ms": 347870,
      "text": "儒教化"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 130,
      "start_ms": 348090,
      "end_ms": 350120,
      "text": "这个儒教已经不是儒教"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 131,
      "start_ms": 350120,
      "end_ms": 352860,
      "text": "儒教讲的什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 132,
      "start_ms": 353260,
      "end_ms": 356800,
      "text": "儒教讲的是我靠"
